WEBVTT

00:08:27.754 --> 00:08:30.373
Only you can write your story,

00:08:30.397 --> 00:08:32.500
and all you need are some tools.

00:08:32.524 --> 00:08:33.815
So what I want to do

00:08:33.839 --> 00:08:36.632
is I want to edit this woman's letter
together, right here,

00:08:36.656 --> 00:08:39.688
as a way to show
how we can all revise our stories.

00:08:39.998 --> 00:08:42.172
And I want to start by asking you

00:08:42.196 --> 00:08:45.632
to think of a story
that you're telling yourself right now

00:08:45.656 --> 00:08:47.777
that might not be serving you well.

00:08:47.801 --> 00:08:50.865
It might be about a circumstance
you're experiencing,

00:08:50.889 --> 00:08:53.317
it might be about a person in your life,

00:08:53.341 --> 00:08:55.309
it might even be about yourself.

00:08:55.793 --> 00:08:58.725
And I want you to look
at the supporting characters.

00:08:58.749 --> 00:09:00.574
Who are the people who are helping you